{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act28side_level_act28side_st02",
  "groupId": "act28side",
  "stageId": "act28side_st02",
  "title": "突然衝擊",
  "storyCode": "CV-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "76bdadad042cc598208097b5596fc7ba31a2188a94c8e4f7f5e0fae23b8fbc28",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "半個月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "優等生，我們在這裡傻等快一天了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "總部信使給我們帶回來的消息，你應該也看了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "消息說他們預計會在明天下午到來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "消息上還說，我們需要提前一天準備接駁需要的各項事宜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "達維鎮的接駁功能本來就沒什麼問題，羅拉花了半天就全部準備好了，然後我們就帶著所有人在這兒乾站著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "如果你覺得太冷，隨時可以去那邊臨時搭的帳篷裡烤烤火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "可如果我不是覺得冷，而是……害怕呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "害怕什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我不知道，我只是……不知道達維鎮的事到底會怎麼收場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷蛇略顯焦躁地把通訊器貼到耳邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒有可接收的訊號，這證明那艘被黑鋼幹員們稱為“本艦”的巴倫基地還未進入通訊的範圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "潔西卡，不再烤一下火了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "不了……天馬上就要黑了，無論如何都會覺得冷的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "潔西卡，你也別太擔心，雖然銀行確實讓人生氣，但本艦馬上就要來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "老闆可不會讓銀行那些傢伙騎到我們頭上來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "……老闆？哪個老闆？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "還能有哪個老闆，克里夫先生啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "他……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "我也說不準，畢竟……說到底克里夫先生是個生意人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "潔西卡沉默著看向平台的方向，手習慣性地伸進口袋，摩挲著其中的子彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "嗯……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "……潔西卡，你看那裡，是不是有火光……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "就地塊上，靠近礦廠廠區的部分，可能是取暖失火了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "等等，不對，起火點不止一個……這、這究竟……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "text": "潔西卡？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "text": "……小隊，黑鋼……艦預計將在……後到達……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "收到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "潔西卡，你去告訴大家——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "隊長，地塊上有數個起火點，不知道出了什麼問題，我得去看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "怎麼偏偏是這種時候……但我們已經收到了本艦發來的訊號，巴倫基地離我們已經不遠了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "潔西卡——潔西卡！你到底要去哪？！隊長，怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "讓她去吧……我們繼續接駁任務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "……什麼聲音啊，大晚上的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "哪裡來的動靜……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "有人在砸動力爐？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伍德洛將枕頭下的銃械摸出，凝神細聽從樓下傳來的響動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "伍迪，快下來！有人闖進來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "嘔……難受死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "早知道……就不喝那麼多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "睏死了，就地躺倒算了……這樣明早肯定就在街邊凍僵硬了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "唉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "什麼聲音……怎麼回事……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "這怎麼回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼工程小隊成員",
      "text": "老、老伯你快走，這裡……唔、這些人突然闖了進來……又砸又搶……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "……什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "呵……原來是你啊，老爺子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "你是當時雪地上的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "我命很大的……老爺子，噓，千萬不要聲張，會引來其他人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "老爺子，當時你很幸運，從我手中逃過一劫，不知道現在還有沒有這個運氣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼工程小隊成員",
      "text": "老伯，快走！你一個人對付不了的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "老傢伙，你居然也在這裡啊。不錯，省得待會再去找你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "海倫娜，怎麼回事？我以為等我下樓，這裡已經躺滿你打倒的人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "……他們這次膽子大了不少，大概是真瘋了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "二位別自顧自說悄悄話啊，有什麼好消息不如講出來一起分享一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "真是不知天高地厚的兔崽子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "老傢伙，那些子彈一定很珍貴吧，珍貴到……你連一個六發的彈巢都沒有裝滿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "你想說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "想想也是，這地塊上供你用的材料也沒有幾樣啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "要不然，這麼多年了，你天天拿著那把銃，怎麼幾乎沒聽說過你給誰來上一發呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "兄弟們，先把這兩個老傢伙放倒，然後就當這裡是自己家，看上什麼就拿吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "你們這些人，幹……幹什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作亂的混混",
      "text": "醉鬼，讓開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "誰、誰讓你在……在這裡鬧事的，呃……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作亂的混混",
      "text": "大叔，我再請你喝一瓶，你好好睡一覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬧事的混混",
      "text": "大哥，真有你的，醉鬼就該往他臉上來一酒瓶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作亂的混混",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬧事的混混",
      "text": "東西拿夠了，我們去下一家？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "text": "里昂，你還好嗎……我先扶你起來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "text": "嘖，這群兔崽子下手真狠，你臉上全是血……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "我沒事……就是頭暈……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "你這店裡面怎麼也被砸成這樣……他們不光砸了櫥窗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "text": "何止是櫥窗……他們幾乎把我搶乾淨了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "今晚到底怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "老爺子，我們時間很寶貴的，就別玩捉迷藏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡詐的混混",
      "text": "你在這對不對！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "煩死人了，這地方又狹窄，障礙物又多，根本施展不開……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡詐的混混",
      "text": "所以別他媽到處亂竄了，老不死的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "唔……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "你這個腿腳，居然還能避開這一下，真是小看你了。看看運氣能眷顧你到什麼時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "呃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "呵，終於逮到你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "你能死在這破地方也挺好，和你很配。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "呼……呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "（就再來一下……堅持住，你這把老骨頭，能行的……一定能行。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "終於可以和你說再見了，老頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "想得美……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "媽的，混蛋，你完了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡詐的混混",
      "text": "這是什麼……蒸汽？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "好燙——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "你說的沒錯，這破地方可是我的家啊，當然和我很配。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "呼……沒人可以在我家鬧事……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "text": "呃……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "text": "都是自找的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "沒錯。我的彈巢確實沒滿，為了讓它們能在我的銃裡擊發，我也確實花了不少功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "所以……我不會把子彈用在你們身上，太不值了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將手銃收回腰間的皮套，老人解開了袖扣，將袖子挽高露出手臂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "不是吧，伍迪……都這把年紀了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "你有多長時間沒看我用繩圈了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "從你把地塊外面那些牧獸都賣給商隊換物資……大概三四年了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "不錯，才三四年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "我去收拾領頭那幾個傢伙，剩下的你能搞定嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "嗯，交給我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "快點的好……離天亮還早，能再好好睡一覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "很可惜，附近沒有幾棵樹能把你們吊起來，不過房檐下……也不是不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "怎麼，都把我們圍得水洩不通了，還沒人敢打頭陣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "別得意，老東西，還有你好看的呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "你們最近都聽說了什麼？今晚到底怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "text": "我就剩這些繃帶了，不夠纏的，你先拿著捂在腦袋上吧……要不然血淋淋的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "沒事，你說你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "text": "最初是從地塊東邊傳來的消息，你也知道，不務正業的小流氓都聚在那裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "text": "說是鎮子裡有很多人都覺得，反正怎麼也還不上銀行的錢，不如……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "不如什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "text": "不如狠狠搶一筆……逃去拓荒地重新開始……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "text": "你也看見了，剛剛他們跟瘋了一樣，到處打人、砸店、搶劫……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "text": "等等，里昂，快來看，那是……你家的方向……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "……該死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "經理，我、我……聽起來外面的情況不太好……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "你大可放心，西爾維婭，在這間銀行裡，我們每一個人的安全都有保障。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "他們確實是些無藥可救的傢伙，只有在我們面前，才不得不變成懂得分寸的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "如果你實在害怕，可以乾脆睡一覺。一覺醒來之後，他們就再也不會出現在你的視野裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾維婭",
      "text": "您這是……什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "其他人沒告訴你嗎？我們的合作伙伴即將到來，這些傢伙馬上就要沒用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "所以，他們主動提出臨走前帶點土特產再出發，我們也沒理由不默許。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "我們只需要等待就好，就像我們之前無數次做過的那樣，耐心等待，該來的都會來的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行員工",
      "text": "經理，我們收到通訊了，是來自黑鋼的！他們的本艦提前到達了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "嘖，不光來了，還來得早了一些……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行經理",
      "text": "不過，對我們來說，都是一樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "看來上次去找你，你還是沒記住教訓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "媽的……呸，每次都說是教訓，都說是警告，你哪次動過真格的啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "我的手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "你要是非想挨子彈，我也可以滿足你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "自己選下一處吧，左腳還是左手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "你根本不知道……就算逃過了我們……逃過了今天……還會有別人……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "你們一個都別想逃……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "與其操心我們，不如先想想自己吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "什麼聲音——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無措的地塊居民",
      "text": "快救火！救火啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "女士，里昂先生在裡面嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無措的地塊居民",
      "text": "我、我不知道，我出來的時候房子已經燒起來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "讓一下，女士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無措的地塊居民",
      "text": "孩子你、你這是去幹什麼？！你不能進去，火勢這麼大，你出不來的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "女士，你快去找更多人來滅火吧，我先進去找里昂先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無措的地塊居民",
      "text": "你這孩子，他是你什麼人啊，要你這麼豁出命去救他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "我認識他的，女士你就鬆開我吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無措的地塊居民",
      "text": "只是認識而已，非親非故的，你不要命了！哎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "潔西卡，你怎麼會在這裡？你、你這是幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "里昂先生？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "你沒在裡面啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "我看到了，潔西卡，看到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無措的地塊居民",
      "text": "里昂先生，這孩子一直說要進去火場找你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "我、我以為你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "……孩子，你別哭了，我還活得好好的呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "可你、你的房子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "沒事的……沒事……我可以去海倫娜那裡住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "正好，家裡只有我一個人，天天望著空蕩蕩的牆壁，心裡也難受……燒了也好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "以後就……再也不惦記了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "是什麼聲音？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "怎麼辦……怎麼辦……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "怎麼辦？我都說了，燒了就燒了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "怎麼辦，怎麼辦，怎麼辦……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "text": "不是，潔西卡，什麼怎麼辦？到底出什麼事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "text": "蒂拉，我看你來來回回進出克里夫先生的辦公室，難道雷蛇小隊失手了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "text": "不，雖然地塊上確實出現了一些突發情況，但雷蛇小隊完成了他們的任務，本艦馬上就要和達維鎮碰面了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "text": "我懂了，那些欠債的人知道我們來了之後肯定沒他們的好處，所以——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "text": "請謹言慎行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "text": "抱歉，我的錯我的錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "text": "不過克里夫先生怎麼說？該不會因為有人鬧事就改變主意了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "text": "一切按原計劃執行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "text": "好嘞——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "text": "……看來我們終於快要到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "起初，是一縷異樣的空氣，拂動了人們的髮絲。\n接著，是一陣從每個人腳底傳來的震動。\n最後，是一聲從數百米外的高空傳來的巨大轟鳴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "衝破冬夜濃重的霧氣，經過半個月的行駛後，巴倫基地抵達了。\n所有人聚在街頭，站在窗口，看向它駛來的方向。\n無論人們是歡迎，或是抗拒，它都來了。\n無論今夜是噩夢，還是美夢，都驚醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "掂了掂手中的銃械，事情做到一半被打斷，讓伍德洛心裡很不高興。\n將目光從遠處的艦船上收回，伍德洛看到地上的男人早已不見蹤影，只留下一行長長的血跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "呵……剛剛應該先對他的腳來顆子彈的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "媽的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
